# ==============================================================================
# Layer 3: .env File Configuration
#
# Precedence Order:
#   Defaults (Layer 1) -> config.<env>.yaml (Layer 2) -> .env (Layer 3) -> OS Env (Layer 4) -> CLI Overrides (Layer 5)
#
# Rules:
#   - Keys can be prefixed with APP_ (e.g. APP_DEBUG) or plain.
#   - Special alias: NUM_WORKERS in this layer maps to the 'workers' key.
# ==============================================================================

